      <h2>About This Kit</h2>
      <p>The TNT-808 is Tormek&rsquo;s woodturning bundle: the two jigs and the tool rest that between them hold every common turning tool, the TTS-100 setter that makes every regrind land on the same geometry, a profiled leather wheel for the inside of flutes, and the handbook that ties it together. Mine came from Woodcraft in August 2026 and lives on the <a href="/workshop/manuals/tormek-t8/">Tormek T-8 Original</a>. Machine basics &mdash; filling the trough, truing the stone with the TT-50, grading with the SP-650, and the WM-200 AngleMaster &mdash; are covered on the T-8 page and are not repeated here. This page is about the turning tools in the <a href="/workshop/turning/">turning rack</a> and how each one goes on the machine.</p>
